* TL072 dual JFET-input operational amplifier macromodel
* Pin order: 1 OUT1, 2 IN1-, 3 IN1+, 4 VCC-, 5 IN2+, 6 IN2-, 7 OUT2, 8 VCC+.
* Typical classic TL072 values at +/-15 V. This is a behavioral approximation,
* not a production-corner or transistor-level model.
.subckt TL072 OUT1 IN1M IN1P VCCM IN2P IN2M OUT2 VCCP PARAMS: AOL=200k GBW=5.25Meg SR=13Meg VOS=3m IB=65p VHEAD=1.5 ROUT=50 RDOM=6.063Meg
XAMP1 OUT1 IN1M IN1P VCCM VCCP TL072_AMP PARAMS: AOL={AOL} SR={SR} VOS={VOS} IB={IB} VHEAD={VHEAD} ROUT={ROUT} RDOM={RDOM}
XAMP2 OUT2 IN2M IN2P VCCM VCCP TL072_AMP PARAMS: AOL={AOL} SR={SR} VOS={VOS} IB={IB} VHEAD={VHEAD} ROUT={ROUT} RDOM={RDOM}
BBIAS VCCP VCCM I=2.8m
.ends TL072

.subckt TL072_AMP OUT INM INP VCCM VCCP PARAMS: AOL=200k SR=13Meg VOS=3m IB=65p VHEAD=1.5 ROUT=50 RDOM=6.063Meg
RINP INP 0 1T
RINM INM 0 1T
CIN INP INM 3p
BIBP INP VCCM I={IB}
BIBM INM VCCM I={IB}
BCOMP 0 NDOM I={limit((AOL*(V(INP,INM)+VOS)-V(NDOM))/RDOM,-SR*1n,SR*1n)}
CDOM NDOM 0 1n
RLEAK NDOM 0 1G
BOUT NDRV 0 V={limit(V(NDOM),V(VCCM)+VHEAD,V(VCCP)-VHEAD)}
ROUT NDRV OUT {ROUT}
.ends TL072_AMP
